# Internal Clinical Situation Classification

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-clinical-situation-classification.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-clinical-situation-classification.md)

## What this is

Internal reasoning: **what kind of care reality is changing?**  
Not a feature, UI label, score, dashboard, or diagnosis system.

## Categories (engine-only)

Cognitive · Behavioral · Safety · Medication transition · Functional · Nutrition/hydration · Sleep · Caregiver strain · Family coordination · Administrative  

Caregiver strain / family = **context** — never replace the care recipient story.

## Priority

Safety → Functional → Cognitive/Behavioral → Medication → Nutrition/Sleep → Admin → Family → Caregiver context

## Never in caregiver UI

“Clinical category detected” · risk % · “patient declining” · category enums

Translate to human situation language only.

